SHADOWING

  × The name `name` is first defined here:
   ╭─[Main.nash:2:1]
 1 │ name = other
   · ──┬─
   ·   ╰── first defined here
 2 │ other = name
   · ──┬──
   ·   ╰── defined AGAIN here
   ╰────
  help: Think of a more helpful name for one of them and you should be all set!

        Note: Linters advise against shadowing, so Nash makes “best practices” the
        default. Read <https://nash-script.dev/hints/shadowing> for more details on this
        choice.
